---
import PresentationLayout from "@components/PresentationLayout.astro";
---

<PresentationLayout title="债券的分类" eyebrow="FIXED INCOME · 生息资产 · 债券" narrow>
  <div class="slideRoot">
    <p class="lead">按<strong>发行主体</strong>分类：政府发的叫主权债，企业发的叫信用债——信用越强，利率越低、越安全。</p>

    <div class="mainGrid">

      {/* 主权债券 */}
      <div class:list={["cardLight", "typeCard"]}>
        <div class="spaceBetween">
          <span class:list={["monoTag", "typeTag"]}>SOVEREIGN · 主权债券</span>
          <span class="typeIcon">🏛️</span>
        </div>
        <p class="typeDesc">政府背书，信用等级最高，几乎零违约风险</p>

        <div class="bondRow">
          <div>
            <p class="bondName">国债</p>
            <p class="bondSub">中央政府发行 · 金边债券</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bondRateBox">
            <p class="bondRateGreen">~2-3%</p>
            <p class="bondMeta">10Y</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bondRow">
          <div>
            <p class="bondName">地方债</p>
            <p class="bondSub">地方政府发行 · 隐性刚兑</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bondRateBox">
            <p class="bondRateGreen">~3-4%</p>
            <p class="bondMeta">一般债</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bondRow">
          <div>
            <p class="bondName">政策性金融债</p>
            <p class="bondSub">国开 · 农发 · 口行</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bondRateBox">
            <p class="bondRateGreen">~2.5-3.5%</p>
            <p class="bondMeta">10Y</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cardNoteWrap">
          <p class="cardNoteGreen">💡 信用风险极低 → 收益率也最低</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* 信用债 */}
      <div class:list={["cardLight", "typeCard"]}>
        <div class="spaceBetween">
          <span class:list={["monoTag", "typeTag"]}>CREDIT · 信用债</span>
          <span class="typeIcon">🏢</span>
        </div>
        <p class="typeDesc">企业发行，看信用评级——评级越低，风险越高</p>

        <div class="bondRow">
          <div>
            <p class="bondName">AAA 企业债</p>
            <p class="bondSub">央企 · 头部民企 · 最安全</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bondRateBox">
            <p class="bondRateRed">~3-5%</p>
            <p class="bondMeta">中票/短融</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bondRow">
          <div>
            <p class="bondName">AA/A 信用债</p>
            <p class="bondSub">评级越低 · 风险越高</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bondRateBox">
            <p class="bondRateRed">~5-8%</p>
            <p class="bondMeta">收益高</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bondRow">
          <div>
            <p class="bondName">可转换债券</p>
            <p class="bondSub">可转成股票 · 股债双重属性</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bondRateBox">
            <p class="bondRateRed">~不固定</p>
            <p class="bondMeta">带期权</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cardNoteWrap">
          <p class="cardNoteRed">⚠️ 信用风险随评级下降而上升</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="footerBar">
      <p class="footerText"><strong>核心规律 ·</strong> 发行主体信用越强 → 利率越低、越安全；信用越弱 → 利率越高、风险越大。收益和风险永远成正比。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</PresentationLayout>

<style>
  /* ---- shared.layout: slideRoot ---- */
  .slideRoot {
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    padding: 0.4rem 2.5rem 0.6rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* ---- shared.layout: mainGrid ---- */
  .mainGrid {
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 0;
    width: 100%;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.1rem;
  }

  /* ---- shared.layout: spaceBetween ---- */
  .spaceBetween {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  /* ---- shared.shared: lead ---- */
  .lead {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #555;
  }

  /* ---- shared.shared: cardLight ---- */
  .cardLight {
    border: 1px solid #e2e2e2;
    background: #fafafa;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    text-align: left;
  }

  /* ---- shared.shared: monoTag ---- */
  .monoTag {
    font-family: 'Cascadia Code', monospace;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: #9ca3af;
  }

  /* ---- shared.shared: footerBar ---- */
  .footerBar {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    border-left: 3px solid #333;
    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
    background: #fafafa;
    width: 100%;
  }

  /* ---- shared.shared: footerText ---- */
  .footerText {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #333;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  /* ---- page-specific 08a-bond-types ---- */
  .typeCard {
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 0;
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
    gap: 0.7rem;
  }

  .typeTag {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }

  .typeIcon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .typeDesc {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #6b7280;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .bondRow {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #e2e2e2;
    padding-top: 0.6rem;
  }

  .bondName {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #333;
  }

  .bondSub {
    margin: 0.1rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: #6b7280;
  }

  .bondRateBox {
    text-align: right;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .bondRateGreen {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #15803d;
    font-family: 'Cascadia Code', monospace;
  }

  .bondRateRed {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #b91c1c;
    font-family: 'Cascadia Code', monospace;
  }

  .bondMeta {
    margin: 0.1rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: #9ca3af;
    font-family: 'Cascadia Code', monospace;
  }

  .cardNoteWrap {
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
  }

  .cardNoteGreen {
    margin: 0.6rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: #15803d;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .cardNoteRed {
    margin: 0.6rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: #b91c1c;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
</style>